  <!-- Dire Wolf -->
  <!--原中文: '幽灵狼', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'spirit wolf',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: spirit wolf-->
  <TM_SpiritWolfR.label>幽灵狼</TM_SpiritWolfR.label>
  <!--原中文: '在一个强大的萨满的命令下，幽灵狼在物质世界里联合起来。狼是一种危险的哺乳动物，但在群居狩猎时，狼是一种令人害怕的力量。幽灵狼会在一段短暂的时间后或者如果它被击败，它们会回到以太中。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Spirit wolves coalesce in the physical realm at the behest of a powerful shaman. Wolves are a dangerous mammal alone but are a force to be feared when hunting in a pack. The spirit wolf will fade back into the ether after a brief period or if it is defeated.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Spirit wolves coalesce in the physical realm at the behest of a powerful shaman. Wolves are a dangerous mammal alone but are a force to be feared when hunting in a pack. The spirit wolf will fade back into the ether after a brief period or if it is defeated.-->
  <TM_SpiritWolfR.description>在一个强大的萨满的命令下，幽灵狼在物质世界里联合起来。狼是一种危险的哺乳动物，但在群居狩猎时，狼是一种令人害怕的力量。幽灵狼会在一段短暂的时间后或者如果它被击败，它们会回到以太中。</TM_SpiritWolfR.description>
